<title>UK: Inn Business in possible acquisition talks.</title>
<headline>Inn Business in possible acquisition talks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>British pub operator Inn Business Group Plc said on Monday it was in talks that may lead to an acquisition.</p>
<p>The company, which did not give additional details, said it would make a further statement as soon as practicable.</p>
<p>Inn Business shares were marked up 1.5p at 68.5 by 0850 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
